---
import { qaCoverage, qaDomains } from '../content/portfolio';
---

<section class="section career" id="career" aria-labelledby="career-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Career Snapshot</p>
      <h2 id="career-title">실제 QA 기반과 도메인 경험</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="career-grid">
      <article class="career-panel">
        <h3>QA Domains</h3>
        <ul class="domain-list" role="list">
          {qaDomains.map((domain) => <li>{domain}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="career-panel coverage-panel">
        <h3>QA Coverage</h3>
        <ol class="coverage-flow">
          {qaCoverage.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
        </ol>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="career-judgment">
      <span>REPRESENTATIVE QA JUDGMENT</span>
      <p>기획 리뷰에서 삭제·변경된 기능과 문서의 잔존 내용이 충돌하는 것을 발견하고, QA 시작 전에 정합성 확보를 요청했습니다.</p>
      <a href="/evidence/qa-process-career/">판단 사례 보기 →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
